  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Fig 7, 'Sample workflow for an antenatal care business, with connections to the supply chain highlighted'. A BPMN diagram with client and health worker lanes: arrival, registration, rapid assessment, danger signs, pregnancy confirmation, quick check, profile and history, the ANC assessment group, the counselling and treatment group (10.1 to 10.9), referral, scheduling and self-care. An enlarged inset shows the tasks outlined in purple as connected to the supply chain: 9 conduct laboratory tests and imaging, 10.5 nutrition supplementation, 10.7 immunizations and 10.9 deworming and malaria counselling and prophylaxis. Source: adapted from the 2021 WHO Digital Adaptation Kit for Antenatal Care.",
